WEBVTT

NOTE
Galbadia Missile Base destruction. Silo covers open, then a massive explosion destroys the base in the desert.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Missile silo covers tilt open behind the chain-link fence, revealing launch tubes.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
A massive explosion engulfs the base. Dark smoke and fire fill the frame.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
A mushroom cloud rises from the desert floor, debris scattering outward.
